commit 768242dab7cc4dd74a5e15cf67db2ea31e361102
Author: Jimi <jimi@ref.finance>
Date:   Wed Jul 8 14:39:22 2026 +0800

    Integration/zip317 fee+hw pczt (#6)

    * feat: add hardware wallet PCZT bindgen wrappers

    Expose create_account_ufvk / pczt_create / pczt_shield_create /
    pczt_prove_and_send as wasm_bindgen methods. All are thin wrappers
    composing existing audited internals (import_account_ufvk, pczt_create,
    pczt_shield, pczt_prove, pczt_send); no audited logic modified.

    * feat: add dynamic fee APIs

    * feat: add PCZT redact_for_signer and combine for hardware signing

    Add two Pczt bindgen methods for the external-signer (Keystone) flow:

    - redact_for_signer: strip spend witnesses and the zcash_client_backend
      proprietary metadata so the PCZT is small enough to transport as an
      animated QR, while keeping the data a signer needs for valid signatures.
    - combine: merge the wallet's full PCZT (with witnesses) and the signer's
      redacted+signed PCZT, ready for proving and extraction.

    Includes the rebuilt pkg/ wasm bundle.

    * feat: add dynamic fee PCZT bindgen APIs

    * feat: support expiry delta for dynamic fee pczt

    ---------

    Co-authored-by: MagicGordon <19465870+MagicGordon@users.noreply.github.com>
